    "text": "I, Mudiyanselage Kumudu Saman Sri Rathnayaka, Returning Officer of the Udapalatha Pradeshiya Sabha, do hereby declareunder Section 10A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, that Mr. Periyasamy Mailvaganam of the UdapalathaPradeshiya Sabha has vacated his office of the member of that Pradeshiya Sabha as he has ceased to be a member of the Up- Country People\u2019s front.",
